  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Turkmenistan - UN-Habitat Country Programme Document (Programme Formulation Grant)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN-Habitat&#x2019;s potential engagement in Turkmenistan involves collaboration with national and local government representatives and stakeholders to support sustainable urban development and enhance living conditions in cities and human settlements. Key areas of engagement will include providing technical assistance and capacity building for urban planning and development; supporting affordable housing and sustainable infrastructure projects; promoting climate resilience and green urban practices; assisting in the formulation of policies aligned with the SDGs and the New Urban Agenda; fostering good governance and stakeholder involvement; and conducting research and knowledge sharing. This engagement has improved urban planning practices, enhanced local capacities, and bettered living conditions, contributing to Turkmenistan&#x2019;s national development goals and alignment with global sustainable development agendas.</narrative>
  </description>
